WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.527
Bi Lipschitz coordinates at regular points.

2
00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:05.566
Near a regular point, every zoom looks flat.

3
00:00:05.716 --> 00:00:08.729
Can a whole open neighbourhood be mapped with bounded distortion?

4
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:15.228
Claimed: yes, with a distortion that depends only on the dimension.

5
00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:18.107
Manuscript only; Lean in progress.
